@shorter_time_pilot
# prose-audit: Grade B — The pilot now belongs to the live labour minister, unions, participating employers and the Finance Ministry, with explicit implementation limits and aftermaths on every route.
title: The shorter-working-time pilot
subtitle: Evidence, subsidy or a reform that a later minister can bury
