@time_headline
title: Promise a universal four-day week before the trials begin
subtitle: State the destination before the evidence and put Lewica's credibility on the line.
on-arrival: young_support += 4; labor_credibility += 2; union_trust -= 2; opzz_cooperation -= 1; labor_dissent += 2; public_trust -= 3; ko_relation -= 5; far_right_agenda += 2; news_headline = "A universal promise outruns the pilot's evidence"

Lewica announces a universal four-day week before the first workplace has
reported. Younger workers finally hear the destination stated without apology;
employers and KO attack a cost the pilot has not measured, and the evidence
programme becomes a referendum on our credibility before it has begun.

- @poland_event_queue: Carry the universal promise forward

